msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Yo.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Hola.」"

msgid "Ami「......What is it?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Qué quieres?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... That's a ton of luggage. Where＿are you going?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... Llevas mucho＿equipaje. ¿A dónde vas?」"

msgid "Ami「A photo shoot in Hawaii.」"
msgstr "Ami「A una sesión de fotos en Hawái.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ami「......What?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, well...... That reminds me, what＿happened yesterday?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno...... Por cierto,＿¿qué pasó ayer?」"

msgid "Ami「Nothing much happened at all.」"
msgstr "Ami「No pasó gran cosa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「There's no way \"nothing much\"＿happened. That was a huge fight.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Cómo que \"no pasó gran cosa\"?＿Fue una pelea tremenda.」"

msgid "Ami「Three people had a little quarrel,＿things got REALLY awkward, then we＿all left.」"
msgstr "Ami「Tres personas discutieron un＿poco, todo se puso MUY incómodo＿y luego nos fuimos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What? Didn't you go back to stop＿them?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué? ¿No volviste para detenerlas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, I'm truly grateful about that. You＿saved our asses.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, te lo agradezco mucho.＿Nos salvaste el pellejo.」"

msgid "Ami「......Sheesh.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Cielos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Look, I understand you're still pissed＿about that fight, but don't take it out＿on me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mira, entiendo que sigas enojada por la＿pelea, pero no te desquites conmigo.」"

msgid "Ami「I have no desire to see your face, yet＿here you are.」"
msgstr "Ami「No tengo ganas de verte la＿cara, pero aquí estás.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Wait a second. Was it something I＿did?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Espera un segundo.＿¿Hice algo malo?」"

msgid "Ami「............Not really.」"
msgstr "Ami「............En realidad no.」"

msgid "Ami「And that is?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y qué es?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're the one who told me to settle it.＿Just so you know, I'm going to settle it＿right now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tú me dijiste que lo resolviera.＿Para que lo sepas, voy a hacerlo＿ahora mismo.」"

msgid "Ami「......Oh I see. Choosing me is quite the＿unexpected turn of events～」"
msgstr "Ami「......Ah, ya veo. Que me elijas a＿mí sí que es un giro inesperado～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh jesus.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ay, por Dios.」"

msgid "Ami「What?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Heh...... What if I said you're right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Je...... ¿Y si te dijera＿que tienes razón?」"

msgid "Ami「Leap into your arms, cancel the shoot,＿and then perhaps we'd make out to＿our hearts' content?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Me lanzaría a tus brazos, cancelaría＿la sesión y quizá nos besaríamos＿hasta cansarnos?」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh...... err......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh...... ehm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Jeez, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cielos, perdón.」"

msgid "Ami「Don't be, Takasu-kun. If anyone should＿be sorry, it's me......」"
msgstr "Ami「No te disculpes, Takasu-kun. Si alguien＿debe hacerlo, soy yo......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Villain?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Villana?」"

msgid "Ami「......Did you hear about why Minori-chan＿came back from her grandma's house＿so soon?」"
msgstr "Ami「......¿Oíste por qué Minori-chan volvió＿tan pronto de casa de su abuela?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... She was busy with work and＿practice and stuff.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... Tenía trabajo, entrenamiento＿y esas cosas.」"

msgid "Ami「So she didn't tell anyone after all......＿Yeah, so, I gave it a nudge......」"
msgstr "Ami「Así que no se lo contó a nadie......＿Sí, bueno, yo le di un empujoncito......」"

msgid "\"Wow, so you were a little worried～?＿Were you thinking that amnesia might＿have been your fault～?\""
msgstr "\"Vaya, ¿estabas algo preocupada～?＿¿Pensabas que la amnesia podía haber＿sido culpa tuya～?\""

msgid "\"Excuse me? What are you talking＿about?\""
msgstr "\"¿Disculpa? ¿De qué estás hablando?\""

msgid "\"......What do you mean?\""
msgstr "\"......¿A qué te refieres?\""

msgid "Ami「......Then, bam, Minori-chan turned＿white as a ghost.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Y entonces, de golpe, Minori-chan＿se puso blanca como un fantasma.」"

msgid "Ami「My face, however, flushed red. We tore＿into each other...... while Miss Shorty＿stood there flustered.」"
msgstr "Ami「Yo, en cambio, me puse roja. Nos＿atacamos sin piedad...... y la＿enana no sabía qué hacer.」"

msgid "Ami「......Then, when I went into the other＿room to \"cool down,\" I came across a＿burglar.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Luego fui al otro cuarto para＿\"calmarme\" y me encontré con un ladrón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not a burglar.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No soy un ladrón.」"

msgid "Ami「Minori-chan dropped everything to＿come home for your sake, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Minori-chan dejó todo para volver＿por ti, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, but that's not all. Damn, I wasn't＿expecting that girl to be such a pain.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, pero eso no es todo. Maldición,＿no creí que esa chica fuera＿tan complicada.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I know she's not that simple-minded.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sé que no es tan ingenua.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You ain't all that villainous. Plus, I don't＿think you did anything bad, personally.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No eres tan malvada. Además, yo no＿creo que hayas hecho nada malo.」"

msgid "Ami「But I did.」"
msgstr "Ami「Pero sí lo hice.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hiciste qué?」"

msgid "Ami「A long time ago...... Then my wish came＿true, in a sense.」"
msgstr "Ami「Hace mucho tiempo...... Luego mi deseo＿se cumplió, en cierto sentido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......You lost me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Me perdí.」"

msgid "Ami「So that's that. Goodbye, Takasu-kun.」"
msgstr "Ami「Así que eso es todo. Adiós, Takasu-kun.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? What's the matter......? Ohh, wait, is＿it time to catch the train?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Qué pasa......? Ah, espera,＿¿ya es hora de tomar el tren?」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Kawashima?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Kawashima?」"

msgid "Ami「Goodbye.」"
msgstr "Ami「Adiós.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Uh, wait a second!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Eh, espera un segundo!」"

msgid "Ami「Let me go. If you bruise my arm before＿the shoot, I'll make you pay.」"
msgstr "Ami「Suéltame. Si me dejas un moretón antes＿de la sesión, me lo vas a pagar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then turn around.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces date la vuelta.」"

msgid "Ami「No way.」"
msgstr "Ami「Ni lo sueñes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Why not?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Por qué no?」"

msgid "Ami「I don't want to see your face. Plus, it's＿nearly time for the train, so I gotta go.」"
msgstr "Ami「No quiero verte la cara. Además, ya casi＿sale el tren, así que debo irme.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kawashima, you kinda sound like＿you're gonna leave forever.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kawashima, suena como si＿te fueras para siempre.」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't tell me - was that your plan?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No me digas, ¿ese era tu plan?」"

msgid "Ami「What if I said you were right?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Y si te dijera que tienes razón?」"

msgid "Ami「..................」"
msgstr "Ami「..................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Say something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Di algo.」"

msgid "Ami「......You're really, truly, SUPER＿annoying.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Eres muy, pero MUY molesto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Say it to my face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dímelo a la cara.」"

msgid "Ami「What? Takasu-kun, are you into that?＿Oh god, that's SO unbecoming of you.」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué? Takasu-kun, ¿te gusta eso? Ay,＿por Dios, no te queda NADA bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm saying if you're going to insult me,＿do it to my face.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Digo que, si vas a insultarme,＿lo hagas a la cara.」"

msgid "Ami「Listen, this is just one of the tools of＿my trade. What you're asking is a tall＿order.」"
msgstr "Ami「Mira, esto es una de mis herramientas＿de trabajo. Lo que me pides no＿es nada fácil.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't recall ordering it. And I know it＿has nothing to do with being a model.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No recuerdo haberte pedido nada.＿Y sé que esto no tiene que ver＿con ser modelo.」"

msgid "Ami「......!」"
msgstr "Ami「......!」"

msgid "Ami「............」"
msgstr "Ami「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Say something.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Di algo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「............」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「............」"

msgid "Ami「I'll buy you chocolate-covered＿macadamia nuts.」"
msgstr "Ami「Te compraré nueces de macadamia＿cubiertas de chocolate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'll pass on those. You better come＿home. And you better make up with＿Kushieda.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No, gracias. Más te vale volver.＿Y reconciliarte con Kushieda.」"

msgid "Ami「Making up might be complicated...... Oh,＿but if you treat me for two weeks, I＿might be able to manage it～」"
msgstr "Ami「Reconciliarnos puede ser difícil......＿Ah, pero si me invitas dos semanas,＿quizá pueda～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......One thing per day, alright?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Una cosa al día, ¿de acuerdo?」"

msgid "Ami「With all that sugar, there's no way I＿could drink more than that～」"
msgstr "Ami「Con tanta azúcar, no podría＿beber más que eso～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Good...... Then I'll let you go just this＿once. But if you don't come home, I'll＿drag you back at any cost.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien...... Te dejaré ir solo esta vez.＿Pero si no vuelves, te traeré a la＿fuerza, cueste lo que cueste.」"

msgid "Ami「You're so persistent...... Well, it really is＿time to catch the train. See you at＿school.」"
msgstr "Ami「Qué insistente eres...... Bueno,＿ya es hora de tomar el tren. Nos＿vemos en la escuela.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. Take care.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien. Cuídate.」"

msgid "Ami「I will............ Thanks.」"
msgstr "Ami「Lo haré............ Gracias.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the......? She really hid her face＿from me as she left......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Pero qué......? Se fue ocultándome＿la cara de verdad......）」"

msgid "Ami「Don't talk to me like that. Shouldn't＿you be SUPER grateful that I didn't＿bring those two into the room we were」"
msgstr "Ami「No me hables así. ¿No deberías＿agradecerme MUCHO que no llevara a＿esas dos al cuarto donde estábamos」"

msgid "Ami「in?」"
msgstr "Ami「metidos?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I really don't get you...... Oh, if it's＿because I haven't done anything, I＿definitely still plan to take action.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te entiendo...... Ah, si＿es porque no he hecho nada,＿sigo decidido a actuar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Starting now, for that matter.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De hecho, voy a empezar ahora.」"

msgid "Ami「Then tomorrow we'd go on a date＿somewhere, and the day after that＿we'd walk arm in arm to and from」"
msgstr "Ami「Mañana iríamos de cita a algún＿sitio y pasado iríamos del brazo＿de ida y vuelta a la」"

msgid "Ami「school, rubbing it RIGHT in the faces＿of midget-Tiger and Minori-chan......」"
msgstr "Ami「escuela, restregándoselo en la cara a＿la enana Tigre y a Minori-chan......」"

msgid "Ami「Rumors would spread at school......＿They'd publish stuff like \"Local Lover＿Revealed\" in the magazines...... I'd quit」"
msgstr "Ami「Habría rumores en la escuela......＿Las revistas dirían \"Novio local al＿descubierto\"...... Dejaría」"

msgid "Ami「being a model and have you take＿responsibility...... Then make my＿comeback as a model housewife......」"
msgstr "Ami「de ser modelo y te haría asumir la＿responsabilidad...... Luego volvería＿como modelo y ama de casa......」"

msgid "Ami「......Then after letting you hear that＿delusion, I'd say \"I wasn't being serious.＿Are you retarded?\" and laugh at you.」"
msgstr "Ami「......Tras contarte esa fantasía,＿diría \"No hablaba en serio. ¿Eres＿idiota?\" y me reiría de ti.」"

msgid "Ami「There, that's Ami-chan's answer.＿Satisfied?」"
msgstr "Ami「Esa es la respuesta de Ami-chan.＿¿Satisfecho?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, that's right! You'll never make it up＿to me for playing the villain last night!＿You might as well get down on your」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Ah, es cierto! ¡Jamás me＿compensarás por hacer de villana＿anoche! Ya puedes ponerte de」"

msgid "Ami「knees and worship me.」"
msgstr "Ami「rodillas y adorarme.」"

msgid "\"Oh my, playing the fool again, are＿we～? You sure about that～? You'll＿end up filled with regret again, you\""
msgstr "\"Vaya, ¿otra vez haciéndote la tonta～?＿¿Estás segura～? Acabarás arrepintiéndote＿de nuevo, ¿lo\""

msgid "know?」"
msgstr "sabes?」"

msgid "Ami「At first, it was just to make her＿remember awkward stuff to shut her＿up, or so I thought. But then I got extra」"
msgstr "Ami「Al principio solo quería recordarle＿cosas incómodas para callarla. O＿eso creía. Pero luego me puse más」"

msgid "Ami「pissed off, you know......」"
msgstr "Ami「furiosa, ¿sabes......?」"

msgid "Ami「......Well, that's why the villainous＿Ami-chan put on that outstanding＿performance, so I hope you never」"
msgstr "Ami「......Bueno, por eso la malvada Ami-chan＿dio esa magnífica actuación, así que＿espero que nunca la」"

msgid "Ami「forget it.」"
msgstr "Ami「olvides.」"

msgid "Ami「I'm not gonna explain it～...... It's just,＿even if my wish finally did come true, it＿didn't help me in the slightest. So it」"
msgstr "Ami「No lo explicaré～...... Es que, aunque＿mi deseo por fin se cumplió, no me＿sirvió de nada. Así que me lo」"

msgid "Ami「serves me right. I accept it as＿punishment for my wrongdoings.」"
msgstr "Ami「merezco. Lo acepto como castigo＿por lo que hice mal.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'd go looking for you, bring you back,＿and treat you to stuff from the school＿vending machines for a week. Taking」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Iría a buscarte, te traería y te＿invitaría cosas de las máquinas＿de la escuela una semana. Me」"

msgid "Ryuuji「turns with Haruta, that is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「turnaría con Haruta, claro.」"

msgid "Ami「............I've...... gone into work mode now,＿so I'm just a fine piece of merchandise.＿Once school starts, I'll be back to」"
msgstr "Ami「............Ya...... estoy en modo＿laboral; solo soy una bonita mercancía.＿Al volver a clases, volveré a la」"

msgid "Ami「normal, so wait a while...... Now let go.」"
msgstr "Ami「normalidad, así que espera un＿poco...... Ahora suéltame.」"
